message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "wikicitation-mcp: A Model Context Protocol Server for Wikipedia Citation Analysis"
type: software
version: 0.5.1
date-released: 2026-10-18
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23458590
repository-code: "https://github.com/jsobel1/wikicitation-mcp"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/wikicitation-mcp/"
abstract: >-
  MCP server with 38 tools that lets AI assistants retrieve Wikipedia revision
  histories, parse citations in six language editions, compute SciScore and
  annotate DOIs and ISBNs through Europe PMC, Crossref, Open Library and
  Google Books.
keywords:
  - Wikipedia
  - citation analysis
  - scientometrics
  - Model Context Protocol
  - MCP
